<title>USA: U.S. corn weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn major net sales activity in the week ended Aug 22 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:    1995/96		    1996/97</p>
<p>  Taiwan	59,400	  Japan    283,800</p>
<p>  Ecuador     50,000	  S. Korea  52,300</p>
<p>  Unknown    -95,400-A	Unknown  -52,500</p>
<p>A- includes cancellations of 56,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Note: weekly exports of 438,300 tonnes were the lowest of the marketing year and were 42 percent below the prior week and the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary export destinations: Japan, Taiwan, Jordan, South Korea, Venezuela.</p>
</text>
